# The bytes of an exit after a torn update whose cleanup the terminal refused:
# run on the `fault-injection` build with the fault that tears the launch's
# update inside its rows and refuses the cleanup after it (`partial-rows`).
# The session ends on it; `wire` is every byte it wrote, the exit's restore
# last. XFX_BIN must start the binary after `keep` has run, since the fault
# fires on the launch's first update.
env XFX_TUI_FAULT=partial-rows
keep
wait 6
snap exit
wire exit
